{"run_id": "98539b23313947a4b6e0ec725237a176", "sequence": 38, "kind": "context.pruned", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T01:27:04.163206+00:00", "data": {"step": 5, "call_ids": ["json_8bc7b962b1a4480493db031b2b260032", "json_a11ea8587ed94aa798ac39b722dce7df", "json_2ada49417c48402786b4b7be29ca3fac"], "reason": "acknowledged_evidence", "retained_executor_state": {"plan_saved": true, "plan_steps": ["檢查輸入。", "依證據作答。", "核對成果。"], "catalog_listed": true, "selected_source_paths": ["brief.md", "metrics.csv", "notes.md"], "verified_evidence": {"E1": {"path": "brief.md", "text": "# 訂單追蹤改版\n\n目標：讓客服在同一頁查看訂單進度、配送節點與異常紀錄。\n\n本次範圍：整理現有需求，保留資料來源，再將待確認事項交給團隊討論。\n\n已知風險：舊系統的配送狀態命名不一致；尚未核對所有歷史欄位。\n", "sha256": "052b349403397ce33e71bb4eb861f51777312cceba2be98730712c4ae2d0fe57", "bytes": 297, "line_start": 1, "line_end": 7, "evidence_id": "E1"}, "E2": {"path": "metrics.csv", "text": "week,orders,exceptions\n1,120,12\n2,150,9\n3,180,9\n", "sha256": "0b83926d68f86f8d019ecdede89333a607dd320351583d42f7d0e2731f02155b", "bytes": 48, "line_start": 1, "line_end": 4, "evidence_id": "E2"}, "E3": {"path": "notes.md", "text": "# 討論紀錄\n\n- 優先處理客服每日查詢的訂單追蹤頁。\n- 本週先核對配送狀態欄位，不直接修改正式系統。\n- 待確認：退貨與補寄是否需要獨立狀態。\n- 範例資料僅供本機 Demo，沒有客戶個人資料。\n", "sha256": "8c6ad0691bb7dafcacbd7765c6870234c1fbb03d17ff5892cbf8bbccf2817876", "bytes": 258, "line_start": 1, "line_end": 6, "evidence_id": "E3", "runtime_guidance": {"origin": "agent_runtime", "text": "保存前逐項對照需求與來源，只用語意相符的來源資訊；缺資料標未提供並說明缺項，只用來源欄名、不造欄名。限制不是輸出項目；按來源修正並附引用。"}}}}, "method": "qwen35_rendered_byte_bpe_upper_bound", "input_utf8_bytes": 8576, "rendered_prompt_bytes_upper_bound": 7300, "tool_preamble_bytes": 0, "special_token_allowance": 64, "output_token_reserve": 1024, "upper_bound_tokens": 8388, "capacity_tokens": 8192}}
